     "body": "<p>I have started a PR for this change:</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo-import-export/pull/109\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo-import-export/pull/109</a></p>\n\n<p>It is not totally complete, but wanted to get this open for feedback.  As I note on the PR there is at least one feature I still need to add, which is cleanup of items deleted between versions, but it should fit fairly straightforwardly into the existing framework.</p>\n\n<p>Apologies for the scope of the changes to the importer class.  I've tried to make sure that it still incorporates existing features.</p>",
